* A dot inside a name: the object's symbols keep it; a macro so named is called by its name,
* not as the macro without the dot with a size (DO_IT.w).
* fixed: e99ca29 2026-10-09 r68togas: dots in names, exg.l, register names in any case, macro labels in a vsect
* fixed: 4f65c9e 2026-10-09 r68togas: a macro with a dot in its name is called by its written name
* expect sym: T lab.a 00000000
* expect sym: T lab.s 00000002
* expect text: 4e71 3001 60fa 4e71
 psect dot_names,0,0,0,0,0
DO_IT.w macro
 move.w \1,d0
 endm
lab.a: nop
lab.s: DO_IT.w d1
 bra.s lab.a
 ends
